DATA SOURCES

Live vessel positions come from AISStream.io, sanctions data from
OpenSanctions and satellite scene metadata from the Copernicus Data Space
Ecosystem, each subject to that provider's own terms of use. The scenario data
shipped in this repository is synthetic: all vessels, owners, sanctions entries
and zones in data/scenarios are fictional.
